Error [E0746]: `function:get` has the `Net` effect, which can't be rolled back inside a `#Transact` block
  --> transact_irreversible_net_is_e0746.jet:6:19
    |
  6 |         r :: http.get("http://x") ?? server.response(200, "")
    |                   ^^^
 Why: A `#Transact` block undoes its work on a `?`-failure; a network, file, or subprocess effect (`Net`) leaves committed external state a rollback can't take back
 Fix: Move this call after the block, or register it with `<handle>.on_commit(() -> { … })` so it runs only on a clean commit
 Denial: transaction
 Call chain: function:<corelib>/core.http::get
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0746
